<title>JAPAN: Yasuda Mutual to invest Y100 bln in foreign bonds.</title>
<headline>Yasuda Mutual to invest Y100 bln in foreign bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yasuda Mutual Life Insurance Co plans to spend about 100 billion yen in new foreign bond investment in the second half of the current fiscal year, a company official told reporters on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
